{"title":"Christmas Ornaments","description":"\u003ch3\u003eFind the Perfect High-Quality Christmas Ornaments\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDecorating your Christmas tree is one of the most cherished holiday traditions, and the right ornaments bring it to life. At King of Christmas, our collection features a wide variety of hand-blown glass ornament sets, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eshatterproof Christmas ornaments\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, and decorative accessories designed to complement any holiday style that are all exclusive to King of Christmas and curated to elevate your tree from beautiful to unforgettable.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhether you prefer a \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003etraditional\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e red and green decor, an elegant metallic finish for a \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003ewinter wonderland\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e aesthetic, or \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003erustic-charm \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003einspired accents, our Christmas ornaments make it easy to create a display that reflects your personal holiday style. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhat are the most popular Christmas ornaments? \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe most popular Christmas ornaments are classic ball ornaments, also known as baubles, which serve as the foundation for decorating an \u003c\/span\u003e\u003ca title=\"Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/artificial-christmas-trees\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eartificial Christmas tree\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Their simple shape and variety of finishes, ranging from glossy and matte to glittered and textured, make them easy to layer into any holiday style.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhether you prefer a classic look with rich reds and golds or a more modern, neutral palette with whites and soft metallics, ball ornaments are the perfect starting point for creating an incredibly decorated tree. Some of our best-selling Christmas ornament sets include the \u003ca title=\"Bronze Nutcracker Glass Ornament Set (6 Pack)\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/products\/6-pack-bronze-nutcracker?variant=42946037252296\"\u003eBronze Nutcracker Glass Ornaments (6 Pack)\u003c\/a\u003e, the \u003ca title=\"Burgundy Essential Glass Ornaments (24 Pack)\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/products\/24-pack-burgundy-essential-glass-ornament?variant=42946036695240\"\u003eBurgundy Essential Glass Ornaments (24 Pack)\u003c\/a\u003e and the \u003ca title=\"Winter Wonderland 15-Piece Glass Ornament Set\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/products\/15-pack-blue-gray-glass-ornament?variant=42319135506632\"\u003eWinter Wonderland 15 Piece Glass Ornament Set\u003c\/a\u003e, each hand-made by skilled artisans. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhy choose the King of Christmas ornaments?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eKing of Christmas ornaments are designed to bring elevated style and craftsmanship to your holiday décor. Our glass Christmas ornaments are hand-blown by skilled artisans, offering a refined, heirloom-quality look that stands out on any Christmas tree. From traditional color palettes to modern neutral tones and metallic finishes, our ornament sets are thoughtfully curated to suit a wide variety of decorating styles.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIn addition to our glass ornaments, we offer durable shatterproof Christmas ornament sets, perfect for homes with children or pets as well as smaller sets that allow you to mix, match, and layer different textures and finishes throughout your decor. Available in pack sizes ranging from 4 to 48 pieces, our Christmas ornament sets make it easy to achieve a full, cohesive, and professionally styled tree year after year. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAre glass or shatterproof Christmas ornaments better?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe choice between glass and shatterproof Christmas ornaments depends on your lifestyle, decorating needs, and overall design preference.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eShatterproof ornaments are ideal for homes with children or pets, as they are lightweight, durable, and designed to resist breaking if dropped. They’re also a great option for high-traffic areas or larger trees where durability is a priority.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eGlass ornaments are prized for their craftsmanship and elegance. Often hand-blown and intricately finished, they offer a more refined, heirloom-quality look that many collectors and traditional decorators prefer.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHow many ornaments do I need for my Christmas tree?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe number of ornaments needed depends on the height and fullness of your tree, as well as your overall desired look. A general rule is to use 10 to 15 ornaments per foot of tree height for a balanced and well-decorated appearance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFor example: \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e6 foot Christmas tree: 60 to 90 ornaments\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e7.5 foot Christmas tree: 75 to 115 ornaments\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e9 foot Christmas tree: 90 to 135 ornaments\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIf you prefer a more minimal look, using fewer ornaments on a sparse tree like the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003ca title=\"King Noble Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/king-noble-fir-artificial-christmas-tree\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eKing Noble Fir\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cspan\u003e allows each piece to stand out. For a fuller, more layered design, styles like the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003ca title=\"Aspen Fir Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/aspen-fir\"\u003eAspen Fir\u003c\/a\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003emay require additional ornaments in varying sizes and finishes. Using curated ornament sets is an easy way to create a unified look while ensuring you have the right number of decorations for your tree.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHow do you decorate a Christmas tree with ornaments?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eStart by placing larger ornaments deeper within the branches to create depth, then layer medium and smaller ornaments toward the outer tips. Distribute colors and finishes evenly around the tree to create a balanced and cohesive look.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMixing different textures such as matte, glossy, and glittered finishes adds visual interest and dimension, helping your tree feel thoughtfully styled and complete. Tree picks and ribbon layered throughout the branches add an extra layer of texture and fullness that ties the overall display together. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhether you prefer a classic, elegant look or a more modern holiday style, the right Christmas ornaments can transform your tree into a beautifully curated centerpiece. Explore the King of Christmas ornament collection to find ornaments that bring depth, texture, and festive charm to your holiday décor.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"glass-sweet-ornament-set-pink","title":"Sweet 30-Piece Glass Ornament Set (Pink - Purple) Limited Edition","description":"\u003cp\u003eSugar spice and everything nice with this candy-coated 30-piece hand blown ornament set. Make your tree a sweet delight with our candy-coated inspired arrangement. With an assortment of different shapes, sizes, colors, and textures, this exclusive KOC Collection set will surely give your tree a desired modern look. This sweet themed glass ornament set comes packaged in a velvet lined box, carefully molded to each ornament for safe storage.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":30092517802048,"sku":"R0T7R3","price":89.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/keriannbritt--styled-for-the-season--2025-12-01-08-08-12--instagram.jpg?v=1765556819"},{"product_id":"glass-snowflake-ornament-set","title":"Snowflake 15-Piece Glass Ornament Set (Blue) Limited Edition","description":"\u003cp\u003eEnhance your winter wonderland at home this holiday season, when you adorn your tree with our swanky snowflake inspired 15-piece hand blown ornament set. Designed with class and sophistication, in beautiful hues of blue. This delicate ornament set will surely make your holiday dreams come true. This snowflake themed glass ornament set comes packaged in a velvet lined box, carefully molded to each ornament for safe storage.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":30092517900352,"sku":"KCX8H9Y","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/SnowflakeOrnamentSet.png?v=1771875630"},{"product_id":"4-pack-snowflake-glass-ornament","title":"Snowflake Glass Ornament (4 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eGive your home a winter wonderland ambiance using our mouth-blown, Snowflake ornament. Hand-painted in a matte silver base, lightly accented with platinum glitter, this dainty glass piece will beautifully complement our snowflake ornament set or make for a great holiday gift for family and friends.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":31757328253005,"sku":"snowflake-4-pack","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/SnowflakeGlass.png?v=1771875694"},{"product_id":"24-pack-white-essential-glass-ornament","title":"White Essential Glass Ornaments (24 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThere’s just something about an all-white ornament theme that permeates an elegant holiday atmosphere. Give your centerpiece the royal treatment this season, when you adorn it with our 24-piece Essential White hand blown ornament set. Designed with the perfect combination of matte and metallic pieces, this refined ornament set will be the highlight of your centerpiece and the topic of many conversations. This gorgeous glass ornament set comes packaged in a velvet lined box, carefully molded to each ornament for safe storage season after season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42319135408328,"sku":"OR24-WHTE","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/24PackWhiteEssential.jpg?v=1714663469"},{"product_id":"15-pack-blue-gray-glass-ornament","title":"Winter Wonderland 15-Piece Glass Ornament Set (Blue and Gray)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday tradition, you can’t go wrong with the classic and timeless blue and gray color theme. Bring your tree to life this season, when you adorn it with our 15-piece Winter Wonderland hand blown ornament set. Designed with elegant hues of blue and gray, this refined ornament set will be the highlight of your centerpiece and the topic of many conversations. This gorgeous glass ornament set comes packaged in a velvet lined box, carefully molded to each ornament for safe storage season after season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42319135506632,"sku":"OR15-WW","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/WinterWonderland-BlueandGray15Pack.jpg?v=1722014545"},{"product_id":"4-pack-rustic-stripe","title":"Rustic Stripe Glass Ornament (4 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThere are ornaments. Then there are works of art. Add a dose of unique rustic highlights to your holiday oasis this season, when you adorn your centerpiece with our 4-piece Rustic Striped hand blown ornament set. With an exclusive design that is unlike anything else, this refined ornament set will be the highlight of your centerpiece and the topic of many conversations. This gorgeous glass ornament set comes packaged in a velvet lined box, carefully molded to each ornament for safe storage season after season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42319136620744,"sku":"OR4-RUSTRIPE","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/4PackRusticStripe.jpg?v=1714663386"},{"product_id":"4-pack-rustic-green","title":"Rustic Green Glass Ornament (4 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eAdd some rustic charm to your holiday oasis this season, when you adorn your centerpiece with our 4-piece Rustic Green hand blown ornament set. With an exclusive design that is unlike anything else, this refined ornament set will be the highlight of your centerpiece and the topic of many conversations. This gorgeous glass ornament set comes packaged in a velvet lined box, carefully molded to each ornament for safe storage season after season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42319136882888,"sku":"OR4-RUSGR","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/4PackRusticGreen.jpg?v=1714663358"},{"product_id":"12-pack-reindeer","title":"Rustic Reindeer Ornaments (12 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eGive Santa’s reindeer the attention they deserve, by highlighting your tree with our 12-piece Rustic Reindeer Ornament Set. With a unique design and quality craftsmanship, these traditional pieces will be the highlight of your centerpiece and the topic of many conversations. Carefully packaged in a velvet lined box, these must-have ornaments are safe for storage season after season and ready to become a part of your family tradition for years to come!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42319137079496,"sku":"OR4-RUSREIN","price":89.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/12PackReindeer.jpg?v=1718159290"},{"product_id":"4-pack-diamond","title":"White Diamond Ornament (4 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWe see you. You have an eye for style and creation. When you want to take your centerpiece to the next level, look no further than our 4-piece White Diamond hand blown ornament set. With an exclusive design that is unlike anything else, this refined ornament set will be the highlight of your centerpiece and the topic of many conversations. These unique pieces feature a white base highlighted by diamond shaped silver accents. This gorgeous glass ornament set comes packaged in a velvet lined box, carefully molded to each ornament for safe storage season after season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42319137243336,"sku":"OR4-WHTDI","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/4PackDiamondwhite.jpg?v=1714663317"},{"product_id":"4-pack-pine-cone","title":"Pine Cone Ornaments (4 Pack) | King of Christmas","description":"\u003cp\u003eTried and true. No holiday setting is complete without the classic pinecone. Instantly enhance your holiday oasis this season, when you adorn your tree with our 4-piece Pine Ornament Set. Designed with genuine precision, this traditional ornament set will be the highlight of your centerpiece and the topic of many conversations. Carefully packaged in a velvet lined box, these must-have ornaments are safe for storage season after season and ready to become a part of your family tradition for years to come.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42319137308872,"sku":"OR4-PINE","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/4PackPineCone.jpg?v=1718159282"},{"product_id":"wooden-garland","title":"Wooden Decorative Garland (3 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe accessory you didn’t know you needed. Hand-strung by skilled artisans, our Wooden Garland demands\n\u003cbr\u003eattention and offers an elegant upgrade to any space in need of some extra holiday magic. With 3 Wooden\n\u003cbr\u003eGarlands in each pack, the decorating possibilities are truly endless. Metal hooks on each end ensure easy setup no matter where you choose to place them. Give your holiday oasis an extra dose of refined style this season, with a pack of Wooden Garlands.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42345861218504,"sku":"GAR-WOODEN","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/WoodGarlandFlatLay.jpg?v=1718159364"},{"product_id":"15-pack-white-silver-glass-ornament","title":"Winter Frost 15-Piece Glass Ornament Set (White-Silver)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the\n\u003cbr\u003eornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the\n\u003cbr\u003emost memorable moments of the season. That means\n\u003cbr\u003eyou can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each\n\u003cbr\u003eLimited Edition Winter Frost Glass Ornament Set is\n\u003cbr\u003ecarefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your\n\u003cbr\u003eChristmas tree and the memories that surround it.\n\u003cbr\u003eWith 15 distinctly designed pieces offering a unique\n\u003cbr\u003efrosty elegance of silver, gray and white; this refined set\n\u003cbr\u003egives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that\n\u003cbr\u003edemands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036302024,"sku":"MLK6K5N","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/P10203892.png?v=1714674799"},{"product_id":"48-pack-white-shatterproof","title":"White Shatterproof Ornaments (48 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhether you have kids, cats, or simply want that extra peace of mind when hanging or storing your ornament collection, you can’t go wrong with the unmatched durability of a beautiful shatterproof set. Each White Shatterproof Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 48 shatterproof pieces offering a beautiful wintery blend of gloss and matte whites; this gorgeous set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that not only demands attention but also withstands any attacks from your furry friends!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036400328,"sku":"QEB2T3M","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/WhiteShatterproofornaments.png?v=1785526273"},{"product_id":"48-pack-red-green-shatterproof","title":"Red and Green Shatterproof Ornaments (48 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhether you have kids, cats, or simply want that extra peace of mind when hanging or storing your ornament collection, you can’t go wrong with the unmatched durability of a beautiful shatterproof set. Each Red and Green Shatterproof Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 48 shatterproof pieces offering a classic blend of gloss and matte reds \u0026amp; greens, this colorful set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that not only demands attention but also withstands any attacks from your furry friends or little ones!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036498632,"sku":"KWZ7N2V","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/RedandGreenShatterproofOrnaments.png?v=1722012770"},{"product_id":"48-pack-silver-shatterproof","title":"Silver Shatterproof Ornaments (48 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhether you have kids, cats, or simply want that extra peace of mind when hanging or storing your ornament collection, you can’t go wrong with the unmatched durability of a beautiful shatterproof set. Each Silver Shatterproof Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 48 shatterproof pieces offering a refined blend of gloss and matte silvers, this lovely set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that not only demands attention but also withstands any attacks from your furry friends or little ones!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036531400,"sku":"WDE2Z3Z","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/SilverShatterproofcopy_1.png?v=1722013751"},{"product_id":"24-pack-burgundy-essential-glass-ornament","title":"Burgundy Essential Glass Ornaments (24 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Burgundy Essential Glass Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 24 pieces offering a beautiful blend of matte and gloss reds; this gorgeous set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that demands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e*Pairs perfectly with our Green Essential Glass Ornament Set (24 Pack).\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036695240,"sku":"ZGS7V7C","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/BurgundyEssentialOrnamentSet.png?v=1714662456"},{"product_id":"24-pack-green-essential-glass-ornament","title":"Green Essential Glass Ornaments (24 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Green Essential Glass Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree 